    <question_explanation no="2" id="PRB-078A0BA2A1E85FCA-Q2">
      <question_stem>정전용량이 1 [μF]과 2 [μF]인 두 개의 커패시터를 직렬로 연결한 회로 양단에 150 [V]의 전압을 인가했을 때, 1 [μF] 커패시터의 전압[V]은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>정전용량</keyword>
        <keyword>커패시터</keyword>
        <keyword>직렬</keyword>
        <keyword>연결한</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>100</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전기이론 · 직렬 커패시터의 전압 분배
정답은 ③이다. 직렬 커패시터에는 같은 전하가 저장되므로 전압은 정전용량에 반비례한다. 1 μF 커패시터의 전압은 V1 = 150 × C2/(C1 + C2) = 150 × 2/3 = 100 V이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>30</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>50</choice_text>
          <commentary>2 μF 커패시터의 전압이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>100</choice_text>
          <commentary>100 V이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>150</choice_text>
          <commentary>전체 전압이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="3" id="PRB-078A0BA2A1E85FCA-Q3">
      <question_stem>저항 30 [Ω]과 유도성 리액턴스 40 [Ω]을 병렬로 연결한 회로 양단에 120 [V]의 교류 전압을 인가했을 때, 회로의 역률은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>저항</keyword>
        <keyword>유도성</keyword>
        <keyword>리액턴스</keyword>
        <keyword>병렬</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>0.8</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전기이론 · RL 병렬회로의 역률
정답은 ④이다. 병렬회로에서 저항 전류는 120/30 = 4 A, 인덕터 전류는 120/40 = 3 A이므로 전체 전류는 √(4² + 3²) = 5 A이다. 역률은 IR/I = 4/5 = 0.8이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.2</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.4</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.6</choice_text>
          <commentary>무효율 3/5이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>0.8</choice_text>
          <commentary>0.8이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="4" id="PRB-078A0BA2A1E85FCA-Q4">
      <question_stem>3상 모터가 선전압이 220 [V]이고 선전류가 10 [A]일 때, 3.3 [kW]를 소모하기 위한 모터의 역률은? (단, 3상 모터는 평형 Y－결선 부하이다)</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>모터</keyword>
        <keyword>선전압</keyword>
        <keyword>이고</keyword>
        <keyword>선전류</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전기이론 · 3상 모터의 역률
정답은 ④이다. 3상 유효전력은 P = √3VLILcosθ이므로 cosθ = 3,300/(√3 × 220 × 10) = 1.5/√3 = √3/2이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{\sqrt{2}}{3}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{\sqrt{3}}{3}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>√3/2이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="5" id="PRB-078A0BA2A1E85FCA-Q5">
      <question_stem>그림의 $L$－$C$ 직렬회로에서 전류 $I_{r ms}$의 크기[A]는?</question_stem>
